        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secret File</strong> is a new <strong>Action Strategy</strong> game set in a Post-Apocalypse setting!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the long-running war between the <i>Argentum Military Alliance</i> and the <i>Technological Superpower TPW</i>, the former were forced to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/eadd4d3068d127ae42d9612efddc5a7f.avif?t=1765122325\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras_big/eadd4d3068d127ae42d9612efddc5a7f.avif?t=1765122325 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, they received important documents from the partisans that could give a tactical advantage to <i>Argentum</i>. A military team led by a legendary unnamed man will have to travel vast distances to reach the capital and <i>deliver the files</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/56f502debcf797492ca4bf7948dbcaac.avif?t=1765122325\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras_big/56f502debcf797492ca4bf7948dbcaac.avif?t=1765122325 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the first chapter, you can</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various fortifications to protect the camp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/e1ebd0b57a17f04308dae472da1c91ed.avif?t=1765122325\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against different types of infected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/2ab5c938211988a135aa9e4c3098dc04.avif?t=1765122325\" width=960 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 18 exciting levels of the main campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and buy new gear in the store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and play different mini games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/9e8183c4d6f2b164e9e98463b0f84506.avif?t=1765122325\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras_big/9e8183c4d6f2b164e9e98463b0f84506.avif?t=1765122325 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
