=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/e1ebd0b57a17f04308dae472da1c91ed.avif?t=1765122325\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against different types of infected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/2ab5c938211988a135aa9e4c3098dc04.avif?t=1765122325\" width=960 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 18 exciting levels of the main campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and buy new gear in the store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and play different mini games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras/9e8183c4d6f2b164e9e98463b0f84506.avif?t=1765122325\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979880/extras_big/9e8183c4d6f2b164e9e98463b0f84506.avif?t=1765122325 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
